{"id":"n71625-1-7","stage":5,"title":"이끌리다 · 被牵","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71625-1-7-1","ko":"언제부터 교회에 다니신 거예요?","zh":"您是从什么时候开始去教堂的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제부터","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제부터","audio":"/audio/826815fe43e6ad2e2110.mp3"}},{"text":"교회에","meaning":"教会","explanation":"교회：教会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"교회","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64370","senseId":"1","lemma":"교회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교회에","audio":"/audio/6c55340f324a9e58ca7b.mp3"}},{"text":"다니신","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니신","audio":"/audio/ba50efcc98d26501315a.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"24c3101dae86eeec","term":"교회","zh":"教会","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3","entryId":"64370","definition":"把耶稣基督视为救世主而信仰并追随的人们的共同体；或指那种人聚集在一起举行宗教活动的场所。","pronunciation":["교ː회","교ː훼"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/023