 dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오게","audio":"/audio/57ddb173306e63af62e5.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"이후로","meaning":"以后","explanation":"이후：以后；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이후","audio":"/audio/ee1d8655d66d382b52a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70757","senseId":"2","lemma":"이후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이후로","audio":"/audio/696efcec527f0c2985f9.mp3"}},{"text":"지금까지","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금까지","audio":"/audio/6552e756bd0ed13d0b77.mp3"}},{"text":"다니게","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니게","audio":"/audio/c98bedf1f46ced22062f.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어요.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어요","audio":"/audio/3b18c9249465f98f5760.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"四","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"64556","definition":"四的。","pronunciation":["네ː"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh"